// Hats, hoods and helmets, drawn over the hair. A hood is in the accent slot (x y z), metal in the metal slot (k l n).
// 25 x 35 (CHARS-B, 2026-10-10): the hat sits on the head (cap rows 2 to 9, brim to row 11). Hats reuse the standing
// frame for their steps, so each draws down, up and left only.

legend G leaf.1
legend D leaf.2
legend F cloth_pink.0
legend Y glow.1

// A cowl that frames the face and drapes the shoulders (the oracle, the artificer, the necromancer, the shade).
sprite hat/hood 25 35

